t_secret.py:198: The missing-field case removes every field, so it never checks that other fields' values stay out of the error. test_missing_login_username has the same gap for token-1.\n- ansible/tests/test_vault_secret.py:89: The direct-call helper installs a fake ansible.lookup_plugins package for the rest of the pytest session, and line 85 adds an unused directory to the global lookup_loader.\n- ARCHITECTURE.md:82: The ansible/tests/ row still says it holds only the filter plugin and role script tests.\n\n### Done when\n\nEach finding above is fixed with a test, or closed in triage with the reason it stays.\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/keepbreathing-infra/issues/76/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/keepbreathing-infra/issues/76/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}]